language models for robotics"},{"raw_text":"MuJoCo: A physics engine for model-based control\n\t\t\n\t\t\tEmanuelTodorov\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tTomErez\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYuvalTassa\n\t\t\n\t\t10.1109/iros.2012.6386109\n\t\t978-1-4673-1737-5\n\t\n\t\n\t\t2012 IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems\n\t\t\n\t\t\tIEEE\n\t\t\t2012","doi":"10.1109/iros.2012.6386109","arxiv_id":null,"title":"MuJoCo: A physics engine for model-based control"},{"raw_text":"Cambrian-1: A Fully Open, Vision-Centric Exploration of Multimodal LLMs\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShengbangTong\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tEllisBrown\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPenghaoWu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSanghyunWoo\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tManojMiddepogu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSaiAkula\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJihanYang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tShushengYang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdithyaIyer\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tXichenPan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAustinWang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRobFergus\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYannLecun\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSainingXie\n\t\t\n\t\t10.52202/079017-2771\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems 37\n\t\tXichen Pan, Austin Wang, Rob Fergus\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNeural Information Processing Systems Foundation, Inc. (NeurIPS)\n\t\t\t2024","doi":"10.52202/079017-2771","arxiv_id":null,"title":"Cambrian-1: A Fully Open, Vision-Centric Exploration of Multimodal LLMs"},{"raw_text":"Dexvla: Vision-language model with plug-in diffusion expert for general robot control\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJunjieWen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tYichenZhu\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJinmingLi\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tZhibinTang\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tChaominShen\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFeifeiFeng\n\t\t\n\t\tarXiv:2502.05855\n\t\t\n\t\t\t2025\n\t\t\n\t\n\tarXiv preprint","doi":null,"arxiv_id":"2502.05855","title":null},{"raw_text":"Robopoint: A vision-language model for spatial affordance prediction for robotics\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWentaoYuan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJiafeiDuan\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tValtsBlukis\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tWilbertPumacay\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tRanjayKrishna\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAdithyavairav